{"parse": {"title": "FW-08", "pageid": 25763, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FW-07\" title=\"FW-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FW-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.B9.B3.E8.8A.9C.E5.B0.BD.E5.A4.84\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"平芜尽处\">平芜尽处</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 平芜尽处</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">After the Endless Plain</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1660308</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>桌面上的茶杯仍然触手温热，仿佛原先坐在此处的人只是离开了片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>呼，我们好端端地回到了这儿，没出什么岔子，也没把自己弄得发疯，真是万幸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>但这趟真算是值得，您所说的故事令我倍感震撼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>您……我该如何称呼您？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>若无其他必须，还请以“葛天”指代我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他答完话，想了一想，清晰且郑重地念出年轻人的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>列昂尼德。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>您请讲，我正听着呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>这一称呼，又是否为你的真实名姓？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>喔，做自我介绍时我曾同您说过，名字不太重要，只是为了聊天儿方便……至少它还算好记，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>但如果您想知道的是那个“更常用”的词，其他职员通常会称呼我的代号，“命名日”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一次互通名姓。来得稍有些迟，近似于同路人友好的点头致意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>那么，来干一杯吧。葛天先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻人摩挲着杯壁，将茶杯高高举起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>为平安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>……为平安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鸟儿伸出翅膀，将面前的茶杯稍稍推向前方，而年轻人放低了手臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两只杯子碰撞出一声清亮的脆响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>我还是没能想明白，您是何时发现我们仍在人工梦游中的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>早在你扮作里正之时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>这……难道是我出了什么格外显眼的岔子？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>实际上，是因你问及了我友人的去向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>其中有些许无法合辙之处，这才使我猜测并明了身处幻境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>另外，扮作里正时，你的骨相实在与外表不相衬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>幻术的确难把握，想必这人工梦游也是同样。你勤加练习便可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>您要这样说，可就太有长辈的架子了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>我们还是快些将问题全理清楚，我好带您到真正的、实在的分部逛一逛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>不妨事，皆为外物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对面埋头翻阅文件记录的人并未听见这句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>我认为，您的确没有敌意，是友善、理智，能够进行正常沟通的对象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>但在最后，我还是要例行问出那个您不曾解答的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>因为对您的观察已经结束，我也做出了结论，您接下来的回答并不会影响结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>嗯。凡事应有始终。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>这是我在最初见面时所提的，我曾询问您，您的骨杖与玉佩哪个更为重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>当时我们试图以此为切入点，了解您是否有某种偏向性——更亲近人类，或是更亲近神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>但您用故事告诉我，这两者对您来说是等同的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>它们的确没有高低吗？如果您真正面对需要失去它们之一，才能脱困的情况，又要怎么办呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>在交谈中，我也曾猜测你们是否会取走这两样物件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鸟儿注视着年轻人的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>我想，你们所求不过是了解更多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>但当我讲述完这些故事，也许你们会注意到另一样东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>我做好了用它交换它们的准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>——若要在骨杖与玉佩之间选择，我会交出我的骨头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>您的骨头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他缓慢地重复这句话，点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>这个答案，是我从来没有预想过的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>合上笔记本，将椅子推回原位，年轻人转过身去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>还得请您稍等一会儿，我需要先行结束人工梦游，然后依据操作流程将您唤醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>……祝您接下来的旅程顺利，我会尽快为您开具登记证明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>此前基金会曾接触了一位岛上的诗人。要是您有机会碰上他，或许也能同他聊一聊您所作的文章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>若是如此，想来确是有趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>还有，如果您在途中得到了新鲜故事……我会始终期待着您的来信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>您会用翅膀写信吗，就像羽毛笔那样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>这也可以一试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鸟儿朝年轻人扬了扬翅膀，像一个简单的道别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>再会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>短暂的独处时光终于到来，鸟儿梳理着翅膀内侧的绒羽，享受着久违的平静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自离开族地后，他所经历的一切远胜过往，却还不曾有机会加以思索整理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>茶叶，墨水，纸张。金属水壶，木质长桌，砖石铺就的地面。所有的人工造物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>山峦、溪水与林木曾是将他环绕的卵壳，如今它们已被轻轻敲破，于是他骤然被倾入一只碗中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>碗壁粗糙，但其中液体清亮，映出天地悠悠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>山下人对杯中之物的喜好，或是由此而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>当时，也应与他们……同饮一回的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鸟儿闭上眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在人工梦游结束之前，尚有片刻可用于怀念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>山下的确喧闹，几乎片刻不得清净，灯火也易扰了眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>我本打算解决城中一事后，便不再逗留。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>如今，却是身在此处，离族地越发遥远。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_getianhuaishu1\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_getianhuaishu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>想来，或许再难回返。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>也恰好借着这幻境，再见上一见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鸟儿仍然栖在槐树的枝干之上，风也依旧拂动着他的羽毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只是未曾动身，与选择回返，两者的心境恐怕不再相同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>……但若是再作抉择，应当仍择下山一途。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_getianbeiying1\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_getianbeiying1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>那位酒坊娘子，年纪尚轻，且颇有些执拗。但所行皆是出自本心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>她与城中众人，恰如同族，彼此友爱。也是因着在此城生长，才使她始终有此为旁人思索的心思罢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>既过得那桥，也应了传说所言的“祥瑞”一词。她应当会高兴。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_getianbeiying2\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_getianbeiying2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>那两名胡商，也曾与我坦诚相谈，面对城中混乱不曾走避，竟也留至最后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>况且，我也得以再见河灯顺流而下的亮光，比过往都更为明亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>水火既济，已有抉择。水天需，逢时机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>她二人终究也有所获。只不知，那位骨相不可勘读的年长者，究竟择了哪一条路。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_getianbeiying3\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_getianbeiying3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying3.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying3.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying3.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_getianbeiying3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>今日所识的年轻人，也是有趣。不知稍后出了幻境，又能见到怎样的光景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>若非身至山下，怎能彻底明了曾在山中。天地过客，皆要入此杯盏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>也好。可趁无事，暂且听风。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FW-08"}}